    "detailed_description": "<strong>About </strong><i><strong>Interwoven</strong></i><br><br>Alrion has spent his entire life fighting in the Hundred Year War. Gylfie has spent hers safely tucked away from it. When the wheels of fate bring them together, two people from opposite walks of life are forced to discard everything they know about the other side, and work together to survive the elements, monsters, and a rogue taskforce that's hell-bent on hunting them down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/0aaf9a59ec42625f800b2c343f961c68.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Play as Alrion and Gylfie in exhilarating simultaneous combat. </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategize every encounter and master each character's individual skillsets.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Earn power boosts through fervent prayer to the Goddess of the land.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play to each character's strengths and gain new skills as your bond increases.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/c82c7e074ae0db012e1f0db018864dbf.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Travel across the continent and protect your comrade. You can't do this alone.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Encounters with abhorrent creatures will test you and your companion.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Massive battles stack the odds against you. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep a watchful eye on the shadows. Anything can happen in the Austere Wilds.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/f60c7a6548d717f1b87c46764b616c9d.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Find out the true cause behind the Hundred Years War. </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compelling dialogue and story-telling will slowly reveal the true nature of this war.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your journey across the continent will slowly reveal new bits of information that will turn the current narrative on its head.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Everything you <i>think </i>you know, may or may not be true.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/6c2d549bb0fc23eaf642b6c5476c5ff1.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/0110bb3803c4d8b40ecde75d6830a3cc.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>Years on the battlefield have given Alrion keen senses and mastery over the art of swordplay. Down to earth and tough as nails, Alrion will never back down from a fight. However, his pride and lack of trust drives him to keep those around him at arms length.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/bd79084b29da0fc8dff29b051d0df672.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>A fledgling mage, Gylfie must use her surface knowledge of conjury to support her newfound companion. Kind to a fault, Gylfie will never refuse those in need. While she is not well-versed in conjury, her quick-thinking and strong faith makes her an effective all-rounder.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>About </strong><i><strong>Interwoven</strong></i><br><br>Alrion has spent his entire life fighting in the Hundred Year War. Gylfie has spent hers safely tucked away from it. When the wheels of fate bring them together, two people from opposite walks of life are forced to discard everything they know about the other side, and work together to survive the elements, monsters, and a rogue taskforce that's hell-bent on hunting them down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/0aaf9a59ec42625f800b2c343f961c68.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Play as Alrion and Gylfie in exhilarating simultaneous combat. </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategize every encounter and master each character's individual skillsets.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Earn power boosts through fervent prayer to the Goddess of the land.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play to each character's strengths and gain new skills as your bond increases.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/c82c7e074ae0db012e1f0db018864dbf.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Travel across the continent and protect your comrade. You can't do this alone.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Encounters with abhorrent creatures will test you and your companion.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Massive battles stack the odds against you. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep a watchful eye on the shadows. Anything can happen in the Austere Wilds.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/f60c7a6548d717f1b87c46764b616c9d.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><strong>Find out the true cause behind the Hundred Years War. </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compelling dialogue and story-telling will slowly reveal the true nature of this war.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your journey across the continent will slowly reveal new bits of information that will turn the current narrative on its head.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Everything you <i>think </i>you know, may or may not be true.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/6c2d549bb0fc23eaf642b6c5476c5ff1.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=68 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/0110bb3803c4d8b40ecde75d6830a3cc.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>Years on the battlefield have given Alrion keen senses and mastery over the art of swordplay. Down to earth and tough as nails, Alrion will never back down from a fight. However, his pride and lack of trust drives him to keep those around him at arms length.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783800/extras/bd79084b29da0fc8dff29b051d0df672.avif?t=1718039631\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>A fledgling mage, Gylfie must use her surface knowledge of conjury to support her newfound companion. Kind to a fault, Gylfie will never refuse those in need. While she is not well-versed in conjury, her quick-thinking and strong faith makes her an effective all-rounder.",
